L001123	\subsubsection{Missingness analysis.} \label{ssec:missingness}
L001124	
L001125	We checked that (1) our allocation tool did not drive differential missingness patterns, and (2) that products with differential missingness did not drive our results:
L001126	\begin{enumerate}
